{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Tui Shou: Sokoban&quot; is a 2D Sokoban-style puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to push boxes marked with different attributes while following rock-paper-scissors rules to move them to designated spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful! Some incorrect moves will cause boxes to disappear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let the challenge begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sokoban, but with Rock-Paper-Scissors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/tuishou_temp_1.gif?t=1749131180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must not lose before reaching the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/tuishou_temp_2.gif?t=1749131180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want more companions? Let's play Rock-Paper-Scissors too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/extras/tuishou_temp_3.gif?t=1749131180\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776590?t=1749131180","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776590?t=1749131180","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/837b9094bf830116a78b4131543dcb8b2b82c6ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749131180","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776590/837b9094bf830116a78b4131543dcb8b2b82c6ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749131180","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Tui Shou: Sokoban&quot; is a 2D Sokoban-s